:"putPlacement","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN. Module: COURSES. Replaces the placement at its stored version (STALE_VERSION). It keeps its ring (another ringId → PLACEMENT_RING_MISMATCH) and its course (another courseId → VALIDATION_ERROR). R-16-05: courseId names a course the caller can read (COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE) with a model (else VALIDATION_ERROR fieldErrors[{courseId, COURSE_MODEL_INVALID}]) at its current version (courseVersion, else STALE_VERSION); ringId a ring of the club with a geometry (RING_WITHOUT_GEOMETRY); activityId an activity of the club and only with ACTIVITIES (else VALIDATION_ERROR fieldErrors[{activityId, MODULE_DISABLED}]). resolvedObstacles and warnings are course-core's, stored as sent (the core never recalculates the geometry). With a critical warning the placement needs force = true by an ADMIN (an INSTRUCTOR with force → FORBIDDEN), else PLACEMENT_BLOCKED (PlacementBlockedDetails: the critical warnings); a forced one audits COURSE_FORCED_PLACEMENT. warningThresholdM defaults to courses.defaultWarningThresholdM; status defaults to DRAFT and mode to TRAINING. The stored placement is no longer stale (R-16-06); publishes PlacementUpdated{placementId, stale: false}.","operationId":"putPlacement","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PlacementUpdateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"S16 Placement","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Placement"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED, COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Api