cation/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UpfrontPayment"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"MEMBER_ERASED, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"AMOUNT_EXCEEDS_DUE, PLAN_NOT_PACK, CURRENCY_MISMATCH","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/upfront-payments/{id}/refund":{"post":{"tags":["payments"],"summary":"refundUpfrontPayment","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403 IMPERSONATION_DENIED). BILLING off → 404 MODULE_DISABLED. R-12-20: the refund of a payment collected by Stripe Checkout (amount absent = what is left); charge.refunded adds it to refunds and a full one makes it REFUNDED; PAYMENT_REFUNDED audit. A MANUAL one has no automatic refund → 422 PAYMENT_PROVIDER_NOT_ENABLED; not PAID → 409 INVALID_STATE; more than paid → 422 REFUND_EXCEEDS_PAID. Tenant comes from the JWT; another club's resource → 404.","operationId":"refundUpfrontPayment","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RefundRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"202":{"description":"RefundAccepted","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RefundAccepted"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"INVALID_STATE, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"REFUND_EXCEEDS_PAID, CURRENCY_MISMATCH, PAYMENT_PROVIDER_NOT_ENABLED, PROVIDER_CONFIG_INVALID","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"RATE_LIMITED","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/training-bookings":{"get":{"tags":["clubs.training"],"summary":"trainingBookings","description":"Roles: ADMIN, INSTRUCTOR (read); MEMBER → 403; impersonation → IMPERSONATION_DENIED. Ring usage register, universal list (CONVENCIONS_API §4), listKey training-bookings; an undeclared filter is INVALID_FILTER. q searches the member's full name, the dog's name and the ring's name (S09 §2, E75). Each row carries its slot's end (endsAt, endsAtLocal) and the member's number (null without one). Without fields every item property is sent; with fields an item has id and the requested keys only. Requires FREE_TRAINING. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"trainingBookings","parameters":[{"name":"page","in":"query","description":"Zero-based page index.","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":0,"minimum":0}},{"name":"size","in":"query","description":"Requested page size: 20, 50, 200 or 1000 (CONVENCIONS_API §4); any other value is 400 INVALID_FILTER.","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":50,"enum":[20,50,200,1000]}},{"name":"sort","in":"query","description":"Repeat field,asc or field,desc; only x-sortable fields.","style":"form","explode":true,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},{"name":"q","in":"query","description":"Free-text search within the caller's permitted projection.","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"filter","in":"query","description":"Repeat field:op:value; operators eq, ne, in, nin, lt, lte, gt, gte, contains, startsWith, exists, between. Only x-filterable fields; otherwise INVALID_FILTER.","style":"form","explode":true,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},{"name":"fields","in":"query","description":"Comma-separated keys of this operation's x-fields; any other key is INVALID_FILTER. A list sends the row id and the requested keys only. An export takes the requested keys that are columns (x-columns) as its columns when columns is absent; none of them is INVALID_FILTER.","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"ListPage<TrainingBookingListItem>","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ListPageTrainingBookingListItem"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, INVALID_FILTER","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}},"x-filterable":["id","date","ringId","memberId","dogId","state","origin"],"x-filter-operators":{},"x-sortable":["startsAt"],"x-fields":["id","date","startsAt","startsAtLocal","endsAt","endsAtLocal","ringId","ringName","memberId","memberName","memberNumber","dogId","dogName","state","origin","createdAt"],"x-columns":[{"key":"date","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"startsAtLocal","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"endsAtLocal","defaultVisible":false},{"key":"ringName","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"memberName","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"memberNumber","defaultVisible":false},{"key":"dogName","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"state","defaultVisible":true},{"key":"origin","defaultVisible":false},{"key":"createdAt","defaultVisible":false},{"key":"endsAt","defaultVisible":false}],"x-exportable":true},"post":{"tags":["clubs.training"],"summary":"bookTraining","description":"Roles: MEMBER (also the impersonation token: origin BACKOFFICE, override{limit, reason} allowed). R-09-06 transaction; the partial unique index {clubId, ringId, startsAt, seatIndex} on ACTIVE is the final guard; without ringId («Qualsevol») the first FREE ring in catalog order. details: TRAINING_LIMIT_REACHED{limit, used, weekStart, weekEnd, cancellableBookings[]}, SLOT_TAKEN{ringId, startsAt, reason, freeRings[]}, SLOT_OUT_OF_WINDOW{from, to}. A repeated Idempotency-Key returns the same response, also a 409/422. Requires FREE_TRAINING. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"bookTraining","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainingBookingRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"TrainingBooking","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainingBooking"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, SLOT_NOT_ON_GRID","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"OVERRIDE_NOT_ALLOWED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED, DOG_NOT_ACCESSIBLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"SLOT_TAKEN, TRAINING_LIMIT_REACHED, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"DOG_ALREADY_BOOKED, DOG_NOT_ALLOWED, RING_NOT_RESERVABLE, SLOT_OUT_OF_WINDOW, CLUB_CLOSED, BOOKING_BLOCKED, INACTIVITY_PERIOD, MEMBER_LEAVING, MEMBER_NOT_ACTIVE, DOG_NOT_ACTIVE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/training-bookings/{id}/cancellation":{"post":{"tags":["clubs.training"],"summary":"cancelTraining","description":"Roles: MEMBER (own or family group, also the impersonation token). R-09-10: until startsAt - training.cancelThresholdMinutes; later only with the impersonation token and a reason (ADMIN_LATE, audited). A booking block never prevents it; a second call is INVALID_STATE. details TRAINING_CANCEL_TOO_LATE{thresholdMinutes, minutesBefore}. An optional Idempotency-Key replays the same 200. Requires FREE_TRAINING. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"cancelTraining","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainingCancellationRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"TrainingBooking","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainingBooking"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"INVALID_STATE, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"TRAINING_CANCEL_TOO_LATE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tasks":{"get":{"tags":["clubs.followup"],"summary":"tasks","description":"Roles: MEMBER for their own dogs (also the impersonation token; not the family group's → 404 DOG_NOT_ACCESSIBLE), INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN (another club's or an unknown dog → 404). Task history of a dog (26, 13), createdAt desc, each with its live attachments and a 5-minute signed url: PENDING and DONE by default (includeDone=true, S10 §6); includeDone=false keeps PENDING; state picks one state and wins over includeDone; includeDeleted adds the deleted tasks, ADMIN only (otherwise 403). page ≥ 0, size 1–200. Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"tasks","parameters":[{"name":"dogId","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"state","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["PENDING","DONE"]}},{"name":"includeDone","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":true}},{"name":"includeDeleted","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":0}},{"name":"size","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":50}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"TaskList","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaskList"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"MODULE_DISABLED, DOG_NOT_ACCESSIBLE, NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["clubs.followup"],"summary":"createTask","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN (MEMBER → 403; impersonation → IMPERSONATION_DENIED). «＋ Afegir» (R-10-10): the dog must be ACTIVE (DOG_NOT_ACTIVE); text 1–2000; attachmentIds are the fileKeys of the caller's TASK uploads, registered in the same Mongo transaction as the task, its D14 row and TaskCreated (→ N-20 to the owner): a refused one (ATTACHMENT_LIMIT_REACHED, ATTACHMENT_ENTITY_MISMATCH, an upload whose grant expired before it was registered → 409 INVALID_STATE with details.reason = UPLOAD_EXPIRED, …) leaves no task. Same Idempotency-Key → same 201. Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"createTask","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaskCreateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Task","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Task"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, FILE_TOO_LARGE, FILE_TYPE_NOT_ALLOWED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"INVALID_STATE, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"DOG_NOT_ACTIVE, ATTACHMENT_ENTITY_MISMATCH, ATTACHMENT_LIMIT_REACHED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tasks/{id}/reopening":{"post":{"tags":["clubs.followup"],"summary":"reopenTask","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN (MEMBER → 403; impersonation → IMPERSONATION_DENIED). DONE → PENDING (S10 §13-12), clears doneAt/doneBy and the D14 completedAt; TaskReopened (CATALEG_ESDEVENIMENTS Annex A), no notification; not DONE → TASK_NOT_DONE (422). No body. Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"reopenTask","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Task","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Task"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"TASK_NOT_DONE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tasks/{id}/completion":{"post":{"tags":["clubs.followup"],"summary":"completeTask","description":"Roles: MEMBER owner of the dog (also the impersonation token, audited DOG_UPDATED with origin BACKOFFICE; a family-group dog → 404), INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN. An account with MEMBER and a staff role completes its own dog's task as the member (doneBy role MEMBER) and another member's as staff (S01 R-01-07). PENDING → DONE with doneAt and doneBy {role, displayName, gender}; the D14 row gets completedAt (not activityAt); TaskCompleted → N-21 to every active instructor. Already DONE → TASK_ALREADY_DONE (422), also for the second of two simultaneous calls, with or without an Idempotency-Key; deleted → 404. No body. Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"completeTask","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Task","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Task"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"TASK_ALREADY_DONE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/