"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/placements":{"get":{"tags":["courses"],"summary":"listPlacements","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN. Module: COURSES. The club's placements, filtered by every given ringId, courseId and activityId (each must be the club's, a course the caller can read), most recently updated first. stale = the ring's geometry changed after the placement was resolved (R-16-06); classSessionIds = the S06 classes that plan it.","operationId":"listPlacements","parameters":[{"name":"ringId","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"courseId","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"activityId","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"S16 List<Placement>","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Placement"}}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED, COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"NOT_IMPLEMENTED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["courses"],"summary":"createPlacement","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN. Module: COURSES. R-16-05: courseId names a course the caller can read (COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE) with a model (else VALIDATION_ERROR fieldErrors[{courseId, COURSE_MODEL_INVALID}]) at its current version (courseVersion, else STALE_VERSION); ringId a ring of the club with a geometry (RING_WITHOUT_GEOMETRY); activityId an activity of the club and only with ACTIVITIES (else VALIDATION_ERROR fieldErrors[{activityId, MODULE_DISABLED}]). resolvedObstacles and warnings are course-core's, stored as sent (the core never recalculates the geometry). With a critical warning the placement needs force = true by an ADMIN (an INSTRUCTOR with force → FORBIDDEN), else PLACEMENT_BLOCKED (PlacementBlockedDetails: the critical warnings); a forced one audits COURSE_FORCED_PLACEMENT. warningThresholdM defaults to courses.defaultWarningThresholdM; status defaults to DRAFT and mode to TRAINING. Publishes PlacementCreated{placementId, ringId, courseId, warnings[]}.","operationId":"createPlacement","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PlacementRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"S16 Placement","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Placement"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED, COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"PLACEMENT_BLOCKED, RING_WITHOUT_GEOMETRY, PLACEMENT_RING_MISMATCH","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"NOT_IMPLEMENTED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/placements/{id}/build-sheet":{"get":{"tags":["courses"],"summary":"getBuildSheet","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN. Module: COURSES. R-16-10: the placement's build sheet, the PDF the client stored (T-16-19); a placement without one → NOT_FOUND.","operationId":"getBuildSheet","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"S16 byte[]","content":{"application/pdf":{"schema":{"type":"string","format":"binary"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"NOT_IMPLEMENTED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["courses"],"summary":"attachBuildSheet","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN. Module: COURSES. R-16-10: the client renders the build sheet PDF (course-ui) and uploads it with POST /courses/upload-urls {purpose: BUILD_SHEET}; fileKey binds that upload to the placement and replaces the previous sheet. Another club's key, another purpose or a key bound to another entity → NOT_FOUND (R-16-16). The placement's version does not change; a race with another write of the placement → STALE_VERSION.","operationId":"attachBuildSheet","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BuildSheetRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"S16 Placement","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Placement"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"STALE_VERSION","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"NOT_IMPLEMENTED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/pack-balances":{"get":{"tags":["payments"],"summary":"packBalances","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403 IMPERSONATION_DENIED). BILLING off → 404 MODULE_DISABLED. PACKS off → 404 MODULE_DISABLED. D10 «Pack {n} — {consumides} consumides · {disponibles} disponibles · caduca el {data}»: the packs of a member (memberId) or of a dog (dogId), at least one of the two; with their movements. Another club's member or dog → 404.","operationId":"packBalances","parameters":[{"name":"memberId","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"dogId","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"PackBalanceDetail[]","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PackBalanceDetail"}}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["payments"],"summary":"openPackBalance","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403 IMPERSONATION_DENIED). BILLING off → 404 MODULE_DISABLED. PACKS off → 404 MODULE_DISABLED. A pack opened by hand (migration, a gift): sessionsTotal defaults to the plan's pack.sessions and expiresOn to openedOn + validityMonths − 1 day (R-12-23); PackOpened. A plan that is not a pack → 422 PLAN_NOT_PACK; another club's member or dog → 404; an erased member → 409 MEMBER_ERASED.","operationId":"openPackBalance","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PackBalanceRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"PackBalanceDetail","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PackBalanceDetail"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"MEMBER_ERASED, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"PLAN_NOT_PACK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/pack-balances/{id}/adjustments":{"post":{"tags":["payments"],"summary":"adjustPackBalance","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403 IMPERSONATION_DENIED). BILLING off → 404 MODULE_DISABLED. PACKS off → 404 MODULE_DISABLED. R-12-24 [Ajusta]: an ADJUST movement of delta sessions with its reason; it may reopen an EXPIRED pack with a new expiresOn (required then). Below zero → 422 PACK_NEGATIVE. PackAdjusted, PACK_ADJUSTED audit.","operationId":"adjustPackBalance","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PackAdjustmentRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"PackBalanceDetail","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PackBalanceDetail"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"PACK_NEGATIVE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/message-templates":{"get":{"tags":["clubs.messaging"],"summary":"messageTemplates","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403). D9 list in D9's order (category OPERATIONAL · PERSONAL · CLUB_CHANGES · CLUB_NEWS, then the catalog's codes, then the CUSTOM ones) with the counts per category (archived ones excluded): every CATALOG template of the club (the seed of a code without one is created here, R-11-01) and its CUSTOM ones; ARCHIVED only with includeArchived. name = the title in the admin's language; variables = the code's, labelled in the admin's language (notif.variable.<key>). With SMS off, caps leave SMS out (the column is not available; the stored cells are kept, R-11-17); with PUSH off, push is empty. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"messageTemplates","parameters":[{"name":"category","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/NotificationCategory"}},{"name":"kind","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TemplateKind"}},{"name":"includeArchived","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"MessageTemplateList","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MessageTemplateList"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["clubs.messaging"],"summary":"createMessageTemplate","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403). [＋ Nova plantilla]: a CUSTOM template of PERSONAL, CLUB_NEWS or CLUB_CHANGES (SYSTEM or OPERATIONAL → VALIDATION_ERROR) with member variables only and no action, sent to members only; texts in the club's languages (the default one required; body ≤ 2000); matrix cells outside the category's MEMBER caps → CHANNEL_NOT_ALLOWED (422, ChannelNotAllowedDetails {audience, channel, cells}); an active SMS cell needs smsBody (≤ 160 GSM-7 rendered with the preview data set). TEMPLATE_SYNTAX_ERROR, TEMPLATE_UNKNOWN_VARIABLE and SMS_BODY_* carry TemplateFieldDetails (details.field, e.g. body.ca). The keys of a {gender, select, …} are stored in lower case (female, male, other: the gender the engine renders). MessageTemplateChanged and CATALOG_CHANGED audit. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"createMessageTemplate","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MessageTemplateCreateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"MessageTemplateDetail","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MessageTemplateDetail"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, TEMPLATE_SYNTAX_ERROR, TEMPLATE_UNKNOWN_VARIABLE, SMS_BODY_REQUIRED, SMS_BODY_TOO_LONG","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"CHANNEL_NOT_ALLOWED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/message-templates/{id}/send":{"post":{"tags":["clubs.messaging"],"summary":"sendMessageTemplate","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403). «Enviar comunicat» (R-11-13, N-24): N-24 or a CUSTOM template only (TEMPLATE_NOT_SENDABLE, 422); recipients = the members of the selection or of the filters (the semantics of GET /members, any status the list shows; NO_RECIPIENTS, 422). dryRun → 200 with the count and nothing written; otherwise 202, AnnouncementSent{templateId, batchId, recipientCount, filters}, one MEMBER notification per member (dedupKey {batchId}:{memberId}) and the ANNOUNCEMENT_SENT audit entry on the template (no changes; details {batchId, recipientCount, filters, selection}, E7-T07). The same Idempotency-Key replays the same batchId (E7-T04). recipients is {memberIds} or {filters, q}, never both nor neither (VALIDATION_ERROR); a member who left is never a recipient (R-11-02); an archived template is NOT_FOUND. The batch goes out with the template as it was at the send (its version and texts): archiving, disabling or editing it after the 202 changes nothing; every announcement's PUSH respects the member's pushClubNews, whatever the template's category (ruling E82). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"sendMessageTemplate","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnnouncementRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"202":{"description":"AnnouncementResult","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnnouncementResult"}}}},"200":{"description":"AnnouncementResult (dryRun)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnnouncementResult"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, INVALID_FILTER","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"TEMPLATE_NOT_SENDABLE, NO_RECIPIENTS","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/message-templates/{id}/reset":{"post":{"tags":["clubs.messaging"],"summary":"resetMessageTemplate","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403). «Restaura el text per defecte»: the seed texts, icon, colour and matrix back, customized = false, enabled kept; a CUSTOM template → TEMPLATE_NOT_CATALOG (422). MessageTemplateChanged, CATALOG_CHANGED audit. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"resetMessageTemplate","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"MessageTemplateDetail","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MessageTemplateDetail"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"TEMPLATE_NOT_CATALOG","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"400":{"description":"Bad Request","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/message-templates/{id}/preview":{"post":{"tags":["clubs.messaging"],"summary":"previewMessageTemplate","description":"Roles: ADMIN (MEMBER, INSTRUCTOR → 403; impersonation → 403). [Vista prèvia] of the saved texts or of an unsaved draft, in one of the club's locales, with the fictional data of that locale; SMS length and segments after transliteration; an unknown variable and an SMS over 160 characters are warnings (the variable renders empty). A draft is rendered as a save would store it (gender select keys in lower case). sendTest («envia prova») also delivers the rendering once to the acting admin's own account (APP and its e-mail, never SMS, never anybody else), stored in the log. Writes nothing else. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"previewMessageTemplate","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TemplatePreviewRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"TemplatePreview","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TemplatePreview"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, TEMPLATE_SYNTAX_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/members/{id}/validation":{"post":{"tags":["clubs.census"],"summary":"Validate member signup","description":"R-04-13–16, R-04-21/22/25. ADMIN; rejects impersonation. dryRun=true returns proposals without writes; false validates using optimistic version. 409 INVALID_STATE details.reason: NOT_PENDING (nothing pending) or CHECKOUT_PENDING (a plan change, or an upfrontAmountPaid above 0, while a checkout of the submission is in progress, S04 §5 E39 and R-04-16; dryRun warns CHECKOUT_PENDING whenever a line waits for a checkout). upfrontAmountPaid in another currency than the club's → 422 CURRENCY_MISMATCH with details.field = upfrontAmountPaid, before any write. Without planId and priceId, a requested plan that is no longer assignable gives a dryRun of the rows as they are (no price) and a validation 422 PLAN_NOT_AVAILABLE. nextInvoiceDate before the first-month start → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR on nextInvoiceDate; while the plan is the requested one, that start is the one frozen at submission. The levels are assigned by the validation itself: MemberValidated/DogRegistered carry the stored levelId, and no DogLevelChanged is emitted. A member who has an account (a readmission, R-04-06/R-04-22) keeps it: no second Account, and the account's login email never changes; only a member without one is matched, or given a new one, by its primary email.","operationId":"validate","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"dryRun","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"ValidationDryRun when dryRun=true; ValidationResult otherwise","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationDryRun"},{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationResult"}]}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"MEMBER_ERASED, INVALID_STATE, STALE_VERSION, MEMBERSHIP_EXISTS, FAMILY_GROUP_MEMBER_ALREADY_IN_GROUP","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"LEVEL_REQUIRED, LEVEL_NOT_ACTIVE, NEXT_INVOICE_DATE_REQUIRED, UPFRONT_AMOUNT_EXCEEDS_DUE, PLAN_NOT_AVAILABLE, FAMILY_HOLDER_NOT_FOUND, CURRENCY_MISMATCH","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not Found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/jso