NG, and the caller's own periods with what each still lets them change.","operationId":"myInactivityContext","responses":{"200":{"description":"MeInactivityContext","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MeInactivityContext"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"400":{"description":"Bad Request","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable Entity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["clubs.census"],"summary":"requestInactivity","description":"Roles: MEMBER, also the impersonation token (ADMIN- or INSTRUCTOR-only tokens → 403). INACTIVITY off → 404 MODULE_DISABLED. R-13-02 [ENVIA LA SOL·LICITUD]: a REQUESTED period of the caller (origin APP, or BACKOFFICE under impersonation, audited with both ids); InactivityRequested → N-18a. Only an ACTIVE member (422 MEMBER_NOT_ACTIVE) without a planned leave (409 LEAVE_ALREADY_SCHEDULED) on a MONTHLY plan (a PACK or SINGLE_CLASS plan → 422 INACTIVITY_NOT_APPLICABLE); fromMonth ≥ E(today) (422 INACTIVITY_DEADLINE_PASSED {earliestMonth}) and ≤ E(today) + inactivity.maxStartMonthsAhead, toMonth null or ≥ fromMonth (422 INACTIVITY_INVALID_RANGE); no overlap nor adjacency with a live period (409 INACTIVITY_OVERLAP {periodId, hint: EXTEND}). The same Idempotency-Key answers the same period.","operationId":"requestInactivity","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/InactivityRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"InactivityPeriod","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/InactivityPeriod"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"MEMBER_ERASED, LEAVE_ALREADY_SCHEDULED, INACTIVITY_OVERLAP, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, STALE_VERSION","$ref":"#/components/responses/StaleVersion"},"422":{"description":"MEMBER_NOT_ACTIVE, INACTIVITY_DEADLINE_PASSED, INACTIVITY_INVALID_RANGE, INACTIVITY_NOT_APPLICABLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema"