validation of the week runs again and validates it too (T-06-23, E5-T28). placementId (S16 R-16-13): the planned placement, with COURSES, of the class's ring. References (INC-40, E11-T10): instructorIds empty is 400 VALIDATION_ERROR fieldErrors[{instructorIds, NotEmpty}], repeated ids [{instructorIds, INVALID_VALUE}], more than classes.maxInstructorsPerClass 422 TOO_MANY_INSTRUCTORS; a newly chosen level, instructor or ring must be active (else 400 VALIDATION_ERROR fieldErrors[{levelIds|instructorIds|ringId, INVALID_VALUE}]).","operationId":"createClass","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ClassSessionCreateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"ClassSession","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ClassSession"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, INVALID_TIME_RANGE, INVALID_SLOT_GRANULARITY","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"OUTSIDE_OPENING_HOURS, TOO_MANY_INSTRUCTORS, LEVEL_REQUIRED, DESCRIPTION_REQUIRED, RING_HAS_BOOKINGS, RING_BLOCKED, PLACEMENT_RING_MISMATCH","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Ser