on":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/build-sessions/{id}/export":{"get":{"tags":["courses"],"summary":"exportBuildSession","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN. Module: COURSES. S16 §14.1 (E77): BuildSessionExportV1, the Unity app's contract, kept byte for byte with the planner's spellings (snake_case keys and values, placement_mode in camelCase, normalized_json and warnings_json as stored). judge_id and event_id are null, venue_id is the club's venue, is_training comes from the placement's mode. The ring needs its geometry (RING_WITHOUT_GEOMETRY) with exactly six active markers, the A–F the app calibrates with, and only those are exported (GEOMETRY_INVALID {violations: [{path: markers, rule}]}: TOO_FEW_MARKERS for fewer, TOO_MANY_MARKERS for more); a course no longer readable → COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE. The server checks the result against the schema: a failed check is a server error (500 INTERNAL_ERROR).","operationId":"exportBuildSession","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"S16 BuildSessionExportV1","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BuildSessionExportV1"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED, COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"RING_WITHOUT_GEOMETRY, GEOMETRY_INVALID","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"NOT_IMPLEMENTED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#